(Japanese: '''{{j|ポケモンクイズパズルランド　ピカチュウたんけんたい}}''' ''Pokémon Quiz Puzzle Land: Pikachu Exploration Team'') is a [[Pokémon manga]] composed by [[Hiroshi Takase]] and illustrated by [[Kemon Kawamoto]]. It was serialized in the ''{{OBP|Pokémon Fan|Japan}}'' magazine from the issue 66 (released on November 30, 2019) to the issue 81 (released on November 30, 2022). The manga utilizes quizzes and puzzles as a method of storytelling. It is 168 pages long.

